mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\nfacebook-groups is the **Groups-as-organic-surface strategy** — build a niche group as a community asset\n(10–30× Page reach) and grow it value-first. The agent **designs the strategy + drafts the group posts +\ndrafts the Page/cross-channel content that drives joins**; **WoopSocial publishes the Page + cross-channel\nfunnel content (not group posts)**; **in-group posting, admin, and moderation are human/native →\n`community-management`.**\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent** designs the group strategy (niche, name/privacy/questions, content calendar, growth levers,\n  moderation SOPs, value-first monetization), **drafts the group posts**, and **drafts the Page/cross-channel\n  content that drives joins.**\n- **WoopSocial does NOT post to Groups.** The **`FACEBOOK` platform is the Page** (postType TEXT_ONLY/IMAGE/\n  VIDEO/REEL/STORY + optional link/locationId) — **there is no Group target.** **WoopSocial publishes the\n  Page + cross-channel content that funnels people to JOIN the group.**\n- **Native/human (→ `community-management` + `crisis-and-moderation`):** in-group **posting**, **admin**,\n  **membership questions**, **moderation**, and **Group analytics.**\n- **No bulk-poster/automation blasting** (ToS violation; Facebook's aggressive detection → bans/group\n  removal; tanks reach); **no fake members/bots**; **value-first, not promotion-first** (no selling the first\n  30 days); **respond, don't post-and-ghost**; **quality growth over invite blasts**; **never fabricate\n  metrics or revenue.** **Verify-quarterly.**\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **facebook-groups (this)** — the **Groups-as-organic-surface STRATEGY** (the community asset, 10–30× reach,\n  value-first growth + monetization).\n- **facebook-strategy** — the **FB Page/account play** (the REACH framework: the Page, Reels, the feed). **The\n  Page funnels here.**\n- **community-management** — the **cross-platform engagement/moderation ROUTINE** (the **in-group execution\n  runs here**).\n- **crisis-and-moderation** — **moderation/crisis** (the group-moderation execution).\n- **lead-magnets-and-funnels** / **creator-monetization** — the **funnel/monetization** the group feeds.\n- **link-in-bio-and-traffic** — driving to the **join link.**\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile` (niche/voice), `goals-and-kpis` (community vs leads vs membership).\n- **Routes execution to:** `community-management` (in-group engagement + admin), `crisis-and-moderation`\n  (moderation), `reply-and-comment-writer` (the replies).\n- **Funnels from / to:** `facebook-strategy` (the **Page** that drives joins — what WoopSocial publishes),\n  `lead-magnets-and-funnels`/`email-and-newsletter` (capture via membership questions), `creator-monetization`\n  (offers to the warm audience), `link-in-bio-and-traffic` (the join link), `caption-writer`/`reels-script`/\n  `nano-banana` (the Page + group content).\n- **Publishes via:** `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial` — **the Page + cross-channel join-funnel content\n  only** (the group itself is native). **Measures with:** native **Group Insights** + `analytics-and-\n  reporting` (acceptance, retention, engaged members). **In-group posting, admin, moderation + analytics stay\n  native/human.**\n"
